Predicate:
  + (equal object object)
Action:
  - move-fast: ?f1 - farm ?f2 - farm
      pre: (and (>= (x ?f1) 4) (adj ?f1 ?f2) (not (= ?f1 ?f2)))
      eff: (and (decrease (x ?f1) 4) (increase (cost) 1) (increase (x ?f2) 2))
  + move-fast: ?f1 - farm ?f2 - farm
      pre: (and (>= (x ?f1) 4) (adj ?f1 ?f2) (not (equal ?f1 ?f2)))
      eff: (and (decrease (x ?f1) 4) (increase (cost) 1) (increase (x ?f2) 2))
  - move-slow: ?f1 - farm ?f2 - farm
      pre: (and (>= (x ?f1) 1) (adj ?f1 ?f2) (not (= ?f1 ?f2)))
      eff: (and (decrease (x ?f1) 1) (increase (x ?f2) 1))
  + move-slow: ?f1 - farm ?f2 - farm
      pre: (and (>= (x ?f1) 1) (adj ?f1 ?f2) (not (equal ?f1 ?f2)))
      eff: (and (decrease (x ?f1) 1) (increase (x ?f2) 1))
Init:
  + (equal farm0 farm0)
  + (equal farm1 farm1)
Pred prop:
  - (= object object): in_pre
  + (equal object object): in_init in_pre
